From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 14:45:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: brcmfmac: coordinate retained firmware with
 J713 system sleep

Drain reset work before suspending the managed radio and require
completed asynchronous setup. Report the D3 acknowledgment and resume
result to the host owner, keeping reset work blocked until both radio
functions finish recovery. Preserve the existing path on other hosts.

Signed-off-by: Erik Bourget <erik@ebourget.net>
[niteria: brcmf-suspend-tests' mocks now have the radio sleep hooks; brcmfmac-sleep-lifetime-tests' mocks have the WoWLAN state, never armed there]
Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Bartosz Nitka <niteria@gmail.com>
(cherry picked from commit 4d20a7264234da6f8b8bc1f5d753a025b504cc5e)
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
